                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The dispatch board\nrecords the right\nparcels in the\nright hands.",
                                  "There is no\ndelivery timer.\nThe care was in\nchoosing\ncorrectly, not",
                                  "sprinting past the\npeople who needed\nthe supplies.\nMoxie adds one",
                                  "small victory to a\nvery practical\nmap."
